DESCRIPTION: 
This pack includes general resources from Windows Vista, for Windows 10. en-US (US English) only.

NOTE: When done applying, head up top on the "Tools" menu, select "Clear Icon Cache", and preferably reboot your machine to see all the changes.
NOTE2: NTMU HAS A NASTY BUG WHICH WILL PREVENT THEMECPL FROM GETTING PATCHED A SECOND TIME AFTER FIRST INSTALLATION. 

Enjoy!

